      "duration": 0.3
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "The SKILL.md output was truncated. I can see it describes the Hybrid Context Hierarchy with Layer 1 (Constitution - inline AGENTS.md), Layer 2 (Reference Library), and Layer 3 (Research Assistant). I need to read the rest of SKILL.md and the other source files to understand the full requirements.",
  "plan": "Continue reading the remaining source files: the docs folder contents, src files, setup.sh, and gen_inputs.py to fully understand the project before creating AGENTS.md and llms.txt.",
