  "analysis": "The SKILL.md output is being truncated. I need to read it in smaller chunks or use a different approach. I also need to read the docs files and src files to understand the project content.",
  "plan": "Use wc -l to check file sizes, then read files in a more controlled way. Also read the remaining source files (src/app, setup.sh, gen_inputs.py).",
