{
  "analysis": "Both AGENTS.md and llms.txt have been created successfully at the project root. The files are visible in the directory listing with appropriate sizes (AGENTS.md: 1454 bytes, llms.txt: 906 bytes). The output shows both files were created with the proper content following the Hybrid Context Hierarchy pattern.",
  "plan": "Verify the content of both files is correct and complete by reading them individually, then confirm the task is complete.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat AGENTS.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.2
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat llms.txt\\n",
      "duration": 0.2
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "ls -la AGENTS.md llms.txt\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
