{
  "analysis": "The output shows both files were created. However, I notice the output appears to be concatenating both files together. Let me verify each file individually to ensure they are correct and complete.",
  "plan": "Read each file separately using head to verify their content is correct and complete.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "head -50 AGENTS.md\\n",
